&lt;b&gt;Temps d&#39;incantation&lt;/b&gt; 1 &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Types-Dactions#Simple.html&quot; title=&quot;Action simple&quot;&gt;action simple&lt;/a&gt;  
&lt;b&gt;Composantes&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Composantes.html&quot; title=&quot;composantes&quot;&gt;V, G, F/FD&lt;/a&gt; (25 po de poussi&#232;re de diamant par cible)  
